          "why": "Core Data's concurrency rule is queue confinement: each context belongs to its queue, and objects belong to their context \u2014 pass `objectID`s across queues, never objects. `perform`/`performAndWait` is the API. Merge policies (`NSMergeByPropertyObjectTrumpMergePolicy`) decide conflict winners. This is a favorite senior filter.",
